@apiBaseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@calendarEventId = replace-with-local-future-calendar-event-id
@platformId = replace-with-local-platform-id

# Configure the required bearer authorization outside this tracked file.
# Use only an isolated local row or separately approved non-production data.

### Read backend-computed recovery eligibility
# Verify status Publishing and canRecoverPublication true before continuing.
# @name getRecoverablePublication
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/calendar-events/{{calendarEventId}}

### Mark the exact stale local attempt as failed
# Verify the provider first. This does not delete a provider resource.
# @name recoverPublication
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/calendar-events/{{calendarEventId}}/platforms/{{platformId}}/publication/recover

### Confirm local evidence was preserved
# Verify status Failed, canRecoverPublication false, and the expected external id.
# @name getRecoveredPublication
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/calendar-events/{{calendarEventId}}

### Confirm repeat recovery is a conflict
# Expected: 409 Conflict with no additional mutation.
# @name repeatRecovery
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/calendar-events/{{calendarEventId}}/platforms/{{platformId}}/publication/recover
